# Accepted unfixed HIGH or CRITICAL findings in the container images (Ruling R29).
# One CVE per line, each preceded by a comment with the reason, the date added and an
# expiry date (`exp:YYYY-MM-DD` after the id makes Trivy stop ignoring it on that date):
#   # <package> in <image>: <why it is accepted>. Added YYYY-MM-DD.
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
# Empty: no finding is accepted as of 2026-11-04.
